{
    "background_story": "Zayn was a master craftsman from a small village nestled in the rolling hills of the countryside. He was renowned for his exquisite woodworking skills, particularly when it came to creating beautiful pieces from the prized applewood trees that grew in the nearby orchards. Zayn's love affair with applewood began when he was a young apprentice, learning the art of woodworking from his father. He was captivated by the wood's unique grain and the way it seemed to glow with a warm, golden light. As his skills improved, Zayn began to create stunning pieces of furniture, each one showcasing the beauty of the applewood. His work was highly sought after, and people would travel from far and wide to commission a piece from the 'Applewood Master', as he came to be known.",
